<title>USA: Purdue University, Ind. yields 5.70 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Purdue University, Ind. yields 5.70 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co Inc said it priced $25.320 million of Purdue University, Ind., certificates of participation with a top yield of 5.70 percent in 2016.</p>
